		{
			"id": "t7_hJ8E05ee8J25X0",
			"name": "Grey Knight Lens: Purgation",
			"local_notes": "Disabled by default; enable only for a Grey Knight posted to a Purgation squad (heavy-weapon specialists: psycannon, psilencer, incinerator).\n\nLore: Purgation squads are the Grey Knights' heavy-weapon specialists, per Codex: Grey Knights background, drilled specifically on the Chapter's own psycannon, psilencer and incinerator patterns (see Imperium/Grey Knights/Grey Knights Wargear.eqp) rather than the standard Astartes armoury.\n\nDesign: A minor Talent (Basic B89-91, 5 points/level for the one-two-skill bracket) covering the two heavy-weapon skills a Purgation Brother actually uses; kept at level 1 (5 points) as a squad-training flag rather than a large investment, since the underlying Gunner and Guns skills are bought at whatever level a given character sheet needs separately.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Mental",
				"Imperium",
				"Grey Knights",
				"Chapter Variant"
			],
			"points_per_level": 5,
